                "language": "python",
                "code": "i = j = 0\nout = []\nwhile i < len(a) and j < len(b):\n    if a[i].ts <= b[j].ts:\n        out.append(a[i]); i += 1\n    else:\n        out.append(b[j]); j += 1\nout.extend(a[i:])\nout.extend(b[j:])\n",
